      <div class="mcp-id__text">
        <p class="mcp-kicker">🔬 Research Lab</p>
        <h1 id="panel-title" class="mcp-id__name" tabindex="-1">Muhammad Zulfan</h1>
        <p class="mcp-id__role">Software &amp; AI Engineer</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <p class="mcp-hint">
      Where Zulfan's research lives. The poster wall has a poster per project, the whiteboard has what he wants to study next, and the bench lays out his methods. His papers are on the shelf. For the rest of his story (roles, school, honors), head to the <a href="/dev">Dev Center</a>.
    </p>

    <!-- // RESEARCH INTERESTS -->
    <section class="mcp-card" aria-labelledby="next-title">
      <h2 id="next-title" class="mcp-h">Research interests</h2>
      <p class="mcp-dim">
        Tactical Edge AI inference, adversarial Indonesian NLP spam detection, applied computer vision, and distributed event-driven systems.
      </p>
      <div class="mcp-fastlane">
        <button type="button" class="mcp-btn mcp-btn--primary" data-open="posters">📜 Posters</button>
        <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="whiteboard">✏️ Whiteboard</button>
        <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="bench">🧪 Methods</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- // RESEARCH PROJECTS (FROM CV) -->
    <section aria-labelledby="work-title">
      <h2 id="work-title" class="mcp-h">Research</h2>
      <ul class="clean lab-list">
        <!-- 1. AeroScan Tactical Edge AI -->
        <li class="mcp-card lab-item">
          <h3 class="lab-item__title">AeroScan: Real-Time Military Aircraft Detection &amp; Tactical Edge AI</h3>
          <p class="mcp-dim">Personal R&amp;D · Oct 2026 – Present</p>
          <p>
            Can custom YOLOv11s models and NVIDIA TensorRT 10 FP16 compilation achieve sub-2ms multi-camera aerial reconnaissance directly on consumer and edge GPUs?
          </p>
          <p>
            <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="posters" data-poster="p-aeroscan">
              Read the poster 📜
            </button>
          </p>
        </li>

        <!-- 2. Undergraduate Thesis: Online Gambling Spam Detection on YouTube -->
        <li class="mcp-card lab-item">
          <h3 class="lab-item__title">Undergraduate Thesis: Detecting Online Gambling Spam Comments on YouTube</h3>
          <p class="mcp-dim">ITENAS — Undergraduate Thesis · Bandung, ID · Nov 2025 – June 2026 (99.56% F1)</p>
          <p>
            How do Indonesian character obfuscations, emoji padding, and intentional spelling variations degrade spam classifiers, and can a hybrid representation of 1,000 TF-IDF character trigrams + 9 statistical features restore 99.56% detection precision?
          </p>
          <p>
            <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="posters" data-poster="p-thesis-spam">
              Read the poster 📜
            </button>
          </p>
        </li>

        <!-- 3. Automated OMR Answer Sheet Grading via Computer Vision -->
        <li class="mcp-card lab-item">
          <h3 class="lab-item__title">Automated OMR Answer Sheet Grading via Computer Vision</h3>
          <p class="mcp-dim">Community Service &amp; Applied CV Lab · Oct 2025 – Jan 2026</p>
          <p>
            Can classical computer vision with 4-point adaptive homography perspective transforms and morphological bubble contour masking achieve reliable automated exam sheet grading on mobile captures?
          </p>
          <p>
            <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="posters" data-poster="p-omr-grader">
              Read the poster 📜
            </button>
          </p>
        </li>

        <!-- 4. Deep Learning Image Classification with InceptionV3 -->
        <li class="mcp-card lab-item">
          <h3 class="lab-item__title">Deep Learning Image Classification with InceptionV3</h3>
          <p class="mcp-dim">Deep Learning &amp; Transfer Learning Study · Mar 2024 – June 2025</p>
          <p>
            How effectively does deep transfer learning with InceptionV3 bottleneck feature extraction generalize to domain-specific multi-class visual recognition under constrained compute?
          </p>
          <p>
            <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="posters" data-poster="p-inceptionv3">
              Read the poster 📜
            </button>
          </p>
        </li>

        <!-- 5. FoodLink & FoodRescue: Cloud-Native Geo-Distributed Surplus Redistribution -->
        <li class="mcp-card lab-item">
          <h3 class="lab-item__title">FoodLink &amp; FoodRescue: Cloud-Native Geo-Distributed Surplus Redistribution</h3>
          <p class="mcp-dim">IDEA FEST 3 National Bronze Medalist · Mar 2025 – Present</p>
          <p>
            Which transactional outbox pattern and spatial index architecture guarantees zero-overselling and real-time proximity routing for high-concurrency food rescue?
          </p>
          <p>
            <button type="button" class="mcp-btn" data-open="posters" data-poster="p-foodlink">
              Read the poster 📜
            </button>
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- // METHODS (STACK CHIPS WITH PIXEL SVGS) -->
    <section aria-labelledby="methods-title">
